WEBVTT

00:00:08.832 --> 00:00:11.412
(laughing)

00:00:11.776 --> 00:00:13.776
[GUNFIRE]

00:00:23.552 --> 00:00:25.552
[GUNFIRE]

00:00:26.496 --> 00:00:28.496
Họ lại lái xe.

00:00:31.700 --> 00:00:32.540
Hãy đứng dậy!

00:00:32.384 --> 00:00:33.384
Buông ra!

00:00:35.328 --> 00:00:37.328
[crying]

00:00:38.272 --> 00:00:40.272
Tôi sẽ hạ gục bạn!

00:00:41.216 --> 00:00:44.216
(engine revving)

00:00:44.160 --> 00:00:46.920
(water running)

00:00:47.104 --> 00:00:49.104
(gunshot)

00:00:49.104 --> 00:00:50.104
- Chúng ta hiểu rồi!
